  "bodyHash": "d3c7ff86968692c6",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ValkyrienSkies/Valkyrien-Skies-2/1.18.x/main/vs_logo.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Valkyrien Skies</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvalkyrienskies.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a> | <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dWwM8G3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Valkyrien-Skies-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fvalkyrienskies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E3AOwJB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flilypad.gg%252fvalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vl7Ov4j.png\" width=\"756\" height=\"152\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>會移動的方塊。能縮放的方塊。具備物理系統的方塊。小型船艦。巨型船艦。有了 Valkyrien Skies，天空不再是極限。</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">注意：<em>Valkyrien Skies</em> 為函式庫模組，您需在一般遊戲中額外下載擴充模組方能使用。</span></p>\n<p> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">擴充模組的列表可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.valkyrienskies.org%252fwiki%252fList_of_addons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方維基</a> 查看，當然網路上還有更多其他模組喔！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uaUCWV5.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>浮力？</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">沒錯。只要您的船夠輕，它就能漂浮！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9uIz9M6.png\"></p>\n<h2>萬物皆會碰撞</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">船對船、船對世界、船對玩家、船對實體。Valkyrien Skies 無縫融入原版遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vMUXLgv.png\"></p>\n<h2>對了，它還支援 Create 模組</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您最愛的 Create 機器現在能移動了！詳情請見 <a style=\"color:#36f;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.valkyrienskies.org%252fclockwork\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clockwork</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ybix8t-GuKM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"857\" height=\"480\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2>以及您最愛的光影！</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8pt\"><em>圖示：搭配 Sodium+Iris 的 Complementary 光影</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XQzCcdH.pngYIcykqj6Llhg=w1280\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"785\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*Valkyrien Skies 為從零開始構建，並非基於過往飛艇模組（如 Archimedes Ships）的程式碼。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>舊版 1.12 描述：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/p8gq6w7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"673\" height=\"356\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em style=\"font-size:12px\">（安裝光影包後的物理效果範例）</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:36px\">問：這個模組已經停止更新了嗎？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">沒有！我們目前正在開發 VS 2（見 <a href=\"https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Valkyrien-Skies-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Valkyrien-Skies-2</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Eureka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Eureka</a>）。目前處於 Alpha 測試階段，支援 1.16 版本。我們將很快在 CurseForge 上發布 Alpha 版本&trade;。請加入 Discord 以獲取每日更新&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies/settings/discord.gg/rG3QNDV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord.gg/rG3QNDV</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:36px\">1.12.2-1.0.0 版本的重要公告：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:18px\">Valkyrien Skies 已拆分為三個模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valkyrien Skies Core</a>（即此模組）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valkyrien Skies World</a>，以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valkyrien Skies Control</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:18px\"><em>強烈建議安裝這三個模組</em>，否則您將無法獲得建造船隻所需的方塊與物品！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">Valkyrien Skies 旨在成為大家一直夢寐以求的 Minecraft 船隻模組。這意味著它包含互動式方塊、在船隻上行走的自訂碰撞體、模組相容性等更多功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">誠然，其他船隻模組曾聲稱不可能或不切實際的許多問題，其實都有解法，而 Valkyrien Skies 就是最佳證明。</span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">我們正在開發完全整合的自訂操控系統，但就目前而言，本模組已足夠穩定，可作為內建於 Minecraft 的物理沙盒使用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外還有以下針對 Valkyrien Skies 開發的擴充模組：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Plasma Cannons</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> by Ice2670:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmacannon\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmacannon</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Plasma Engines</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> by Ice2670:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmaengines\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmaengines</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">Valkyrien Skies 官方網站：<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvalkyrienskies.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">valkyrienskies.org</a></span><br>Valkyrien Skies 維基：<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.valkyrienskies.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">wiki.valkyrienskies.org</a></span><br>Github：<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Valkyrien-Skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Valkyrien-Skies</a></span><br>Discord：<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rG3QNDV\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord.gg/rG3QNDV</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/triode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eVOaqEx.png\" alt=\"patreon.com/triode\" width=\"288\" height=\"100\"></span></a></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">飛艇戰鬥範例：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n3vrmoxQ8Cg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
